      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Chance to cheer around the great MAGNIFICENT STORM NZ (9) again. Form this prep has been excellent and he made it two from two when successful at his latest appearance over 2130m at this track, getting home by 4.5 metres. Tackles a similar assignment and he can grab another win at what seem sure to be skinny prices. Danger and the quinella horse can be SOHO SHAKEDOWN (1) who scored at the first run back from a layoff last start over 2130m at this track on August 7, finishing 1.1 metres ahead of his rivals. Has the benefit of a good draw. IM LIGHTNING BANNER NZ (4) was responsible for a better effort last time out when runner-up over 2130m at this track. Should run a big race and SWEET PINS NZ (10) is a reliable conveyance who can be around the mark. Was second most recently at this track, running well, and should do again.",
